{"ID":"20230925154102-3xppt7i","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230925154102-3xppt7i","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154102-3xppt7i\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154132-oed9she\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154133-kqw13rj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154133-kqw13rj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"【王不留行散】","type":"doc","updated":"20230925154133"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230925154132-oed9she","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154132-oed9she","updated":"20230925154132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：王不留行十分（烧）、蒴藋细叶十分（烧）、桑根白皮十分（烧）、甘草十八分、黄芩二分、蜀椒三分（去目）、厚朴二分、干姜二分、芍药二分；"}]},{"ID":"20230925154132-ka5bzmj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154132-ka5bzmj","updated":"20230925154132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右九味，为散，饮服方寸匙。小疮即粉之，大疮即服之，产后亦可服。"}]},{"ID":"20230925154133-kqw13rj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154133-kqw13rj"}}]}